<title>BELGIUM: Glaverbel to pay 28 bfr gross interim div.</title>
<headline>Glaverbel to pay 28 bfr gross interim div.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian glass producer Glaverbel SA said in a statement on Wednesday its board has decided to pay out a gross interim dividend of 28 francs per share, payable in cash as of December 2, 1996.</p>
<p>For ordinary shares without VVPR strip the net interim dividend will amount to 21 francs. For VVPR shares the net interim dividend will amount to 23.80 francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
